{"id":"wb-7-452","name":"圜丘遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"圜丘遗址","text":"圜丘遗址，也称唐天坛，始建于隋朝，为隋唐两朝皇帝祭天的场所，位于长安之南。唐亡以后，天坛废弃，坛体遗址犹存。现位于陕西省西安市雁塔区长延堡街道天坛路天坛遗址公园内。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%9C%E4%B8%98%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91316913,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91316913","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ea2e14d5eec71b0d71cb0744.jpg","title":"圜丘遗址2020_(1).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9C%9C%E4%B8%98%E9%81%97%E5%9D%802020_(1).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/%E5%9C%9C%E4%B8%98%E9%81%97%E5%9D%802020_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西安市雁塔区 圜丘遗址","width":320,"height":200}}